            "location": "src/workflow/code-review/investigation/navigation.ts:1",
            "message": "untilInvestigationAborted races `work` against the AbortSignal via a nested `abort` callback. If `abort` is registered with signal.addEventListener('abort', ...) and there is no corresponding removeEventListener once the race settles (whichever side wins), repeated calls against a long-lived or reused AbortSignal (e.g. capability() invoked per poll/per test case) will accumulate abort listeners — a resource leak and potential late/duplicate rejection if the signal later fires after `work` already resolved.",
